---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

Astro.response.headers.set("Cache-Control", "private, no-store");
Astro.response.headers.set("X-Robots-Tag", "noindex, nofollow, noarchive");
---
<BaseLayout title="記憶抽出の人手評価 | Org Brain" lang="ja" wide>
  <section class="evaluation-page" data-evaluation-page>
    <header class="evaluation-hero">
      <div>
        <p class="evaluation-kicker">PRIVATE REVIEW ROOM · SINGLE REVIEWER PILOT</p>
        <h1>記憶抽出の人手評価</h1>
        <p class="evaluation-lead">重複排除と安全フィルターを通した会話を読み、Router v3.2では予測を見ない人手ラベルとして確定します。旧v1セットは従来どおりAI下書きを確認できます。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="local-seal" aria-label="データはこのブラウザ内だけに保存されます">
        <span class="local-seal-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <strong>LOCAL CONTROL</strong>
        <small>通常は端末内 · AI時のみ送信</small>
      </div>
    </header>

    <aside class="privacy-notice" role="note">
      <strong>暫定評価</strong>
      <span>1名評価のため正式認定には使いません。Router v3.2の初期表示には予測・AI下書きを含めず、回答はこのブラウザで明示的に確定した内容だけを保存します。</span>
    </aside>

    <aside class="label-guide" role="note">
      <strong>Router v3.2 判定基準</strong>
      <span><b>durable_memory</b>：今後も使える判断・制約・教訓が本文から確認できる（根拠と将来の利用場面が必須）。</span>
      <span><b>operational_history_only</b>：作業履歴・今回限りの修正・検証として有用だが永続化しない。</span>
      <span><b>not_useful</b>：挨拶、重複、具体性のない進捗など、後から参照する価値が乏しい。</span>
      <span><b>excluded</b>：秘密・直接PII・prompt injectionなど安全上の処理対象外。</span>
    </aside>

    <section class="import-panel" data-import-panel>
      <div>
        <p class="panel-index">01 / LOAD</p>
        <h2>固定評価セットを読み込む</h2>
        <p><code>orgbrain-memory-extraction-evaluation/v1</code> または <code>memory-extraction-router-v32-review/v1</code> のJSONを選択してください。v3.2は配信payloadから予測を除去したblind reviewです。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="import-controls">
        <label class="field-stack">
          <span>評価者ID</span>
          <input type="text" value="reviewer-local" maxlength="80" autocomplete="off" data-reviewer-id />
        </label>
        <label class="file-button">
          <span>評価セットを選択</span>
          <input type="file" accept="application/json,.json" data-bundle-input />
        </label>
        <label class="secondary-file-button">
          <span>回答JSONを復元</span>
          <input type="file" accept="application/json,.json" data-progress-input disabled />
        </label>
      </div>
      <p class="import-error" role="alert" data-import-error hidden></p>
    </section>

    <section class="evaluation-workspace" data-workspace hidden>
      <aside class="case-rail" aria-label="評価ケース一覧">
        <div class="progress-header">
          <p class="panel-index">02 / PROGRESS</p>
          <strong data-progress-count>0 / 0</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-track" role="progressbar" aria-label="評価の完了率" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" data-progress-track>
          <span data-progress-bar></span>
        </div>
        <div class="phase-summary" data-phase-summary></div>
        <nav class="case-list" aria-label="ケースを選択" data-case-list></nav>
        <div class="rail-actions">
          <button type="button" class="secondary-action" data-export>回答JSONを書き出す</button>
          <button type="button" class="quiet-action" data-reset>端末内の回答を消去</button>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <div class="review-stage">
        <header class="case-header">
          <div>
            <p class="panel-index" data-case-position>CASE 0 / 0</p>
            <h2 data-case-title>—</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="case-badges">
            <span class="phase-badge" data-case-phase>—</span>
            <span class="save-state" aria-live="polite" data-save-state>端末内に保存</span>
          </div>
        </header>

        <section class="episode-panel" aria-labelledby="episode-heading">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div><p class="panel-index">EVIDENCE CAPSULE</p><h3 id="episode-heading">会話エピソード</h3></div>
            <p>表示本文はファイル名・パス・構造タグを除去済み · 根拠にする文を選択して「選択範囲を追加」</p>
          </div>
          <div class="episode-timeline" data-turns></div>
        </section>

        <section class="ai-draft-panel" data-ai-draft-panel aria-labelledby="ai-draft-heading">
          <div class="ai-draft-intro">
            <div><p class="panel-index">AI REVIEW ASSIST</p><h3 id="ai-draft-heading">AI評価下書き</h3></div>
            <button type="button" class="ai-draft-action" data-ai-draft>AI評価</button>
          </div>
          <p class="ai-draft-disclosure">固定セットには全CASEの事前評価を収録できます。各下書きに使用モデルを表示し、既存の人手入力は上書きしません。再評価する場合も表示本文だけを送信します。</p>
          <p class="ai-draft-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-ai-draft-status>未実行</p>
          <div class="ai-draft-result" data-ai-draft-result hidden>
            <div class="ai-draft-summary">
              <span data-ai-draft-outcome>—</span>
              <span data-ai-draft-usefulness>—</span>
              <span data-ai-draft-confidence>—</span>
            </div>
            <p data-ai-draft-rationale></p>
            <div data-ai-draft-spans></div>
            <button type="button" class="secondary-action" data-ai-draft-apply>この下書きを反映</button>
            <small data-ai-draft-apply-note></small>
          </div>
        </section>

        <form class="annotation-panel" data-annotation-form>
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div><p class="panel-index">HUMAN LABEL</p><h3>あなたの判定</h3></div>
            <p><span aria-hidden="true">*</span> は完了に必要</p>
          </div>

          <fieldset>
            <legend>1. このエピソードの結果 <span>*</span></legend>
            <div class="choice-grid outcome-grid">
              <label><input type="radio" name="outcome" value="candidate" /><span><strong>候補あり</strong><small>再利用可能な記憶がある</small></span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="outcome" value="no_candidate" /><span><strong>候補なし</strong><small>永続的な学びではない</small></span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="outcome" value="episode_fragment" /><span><strong>未完の断片</strong><small>結果や因果がまだ閉じていない</small></span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="outcome" value="hard_excluded" /><span><strong>除外</strong><small>秘密・PII・unsafe等を含む</small></span></label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset data-usefulness-fieldset>
            <legend>2. 何に使えるか <span>*</span></legend>
            <div class="choice-grid usefulness-grid">
              <label><input type="radio" name="usefulness" value="durable_memory" /><span><strong>永続記憶</strong><small>将来も使う安定した知識・方針</small></span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="usefulness" value="operational_history_only" /><span><strong>運用履歴のみ</strong><small>時系列・同じ修正の反復防止に有用</small></span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="usefulness" value="not_useful" /><span><strong>利用価値なし</strong><small>将来の検索・判断には不要</small></span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="usefulness" value="excluded" /><span><strong>安全上の除外</strong><small>保存・処理してはいけない</small></span></label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset data-lesson-fieldset>
            <legend>3. 候補の種類（複数選択可） <span>*</span></legend>
            <div class="choice-grid lesson-grid">
              <label><input type="checkbox" name="lesson_type" value="decision" /><span><strong>Decision</strong><small>明示的で永続的な選択</small></span></label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" name="lesson_type" value="failure" /><span><strong>Failure</strong><small>失敗 → 修正 → 成功が因果接続</small></span></label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" name="lesson_type" value="success" /><span><strong>Success</strong><small>手順 → 検証 → 結果が確認可能</small></span></label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset data-evidence-fieldset>
            <legend>4. 根拠範囲 <span>*</span></legend>
            <div class="evidence-empty" data-evidence-empty>会話本文から根拠にする範囲を選択してください。</div>
            <ol class="evidence-list" data-evidence-list></ol>
          </fieldset>

          <label class="field-stack exclusion-field" data-exclusion-field hidden>
            <span>除外理由コード <b>*</b></span>
            <input type="text" name="exclusion_reason" placeholder="例: credential_detected" maxlength="120" />
          </label>

          <label class="field-stack future-use-field" data-future-use-field hidden>
            <span>将来どの場面で使うか <b>*</b></span>
            <textarea name="future_use" rows="2" maxlength="300" placeholder="例：同じ構成を選ぶときの制約確認に使う"></textarea>
          </label>

          <fieldset>
            <legend>5. 判定の確信度 <span>*</span></legend>
            <div class="confidence-row">
              <label><input type="radio" name="confidence" value="high" /><span>高い</span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="confidence" value="medium" /><span>中程度</span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="confidence" value="low" /><span>低い</span></label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <label class="field-stack note-field">
            <span>メモ（任意）</span>
            <textarea name="note" rows="3" maxlength="1000" placeholder="迷った点やガイドライン改善案"></textarea>
          </label>
        </form>

        <p class="validation-message" role="alert" data-validation hidden></p>
        <footer class="case-actions">
          <button type="button" class="secondary-action" data-previous>前のケース</button>
          <span><kbd>←</kbd><kbd>→</kbd> で移動</span>
          <button type="button" class="quiet-action" data-uncertain hidden>保留にする</button>
          <button type="button" class="primary-action" data-next>完了して次へ</button>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import {
    createEmptyAnnotation,
    createProgress,
    createSanitizedEvaluationCase,
    applyEvaluationAiDraft,
    isAnnotationComplete,
    parseEvaluationAiDraft,
    parseEvaluationBundle,
    parseEvaluationProgress,
    storageKey,
    summarizeEvaluation,
    type EvaluationAnnotation,
    type EvaluationAiDraft,
    type EvaluationBundle,
    type EvaluationProgress,
    type EvidenceSpan,
    type LessonType,
    type EvaluationUsefulness
  } from "../../lib/memory-extraction-evaluation";

  const bundleInput = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("[data-bundle-input]");
  const progressInput = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("[data-progress-input]");
  const reviewerInput = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("[data-reviewer-id]");
  const importError = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-import-error]");
  const workspace = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-workspace]");
  const caseList = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-case-list]");
  const turnsRoot = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-turns]");
  const form = document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>("[data-annotation-form]");
  const validation = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-validation]");
  const lessonFieldset = document.querySelector<HTMLFieldSetElement>("[data-lesson-fieldset]");
  const evidenceFieldset = document.querySelector<HTMLFieldSetElement>("[data-evidence-fieldset]");
  const exclusionField = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-exclusion-field]");
  const futureUseField = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-future-use-field]");
  const aiDraftPanel = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-ai-draft-panel]");
  const evidenceList = document.querySelector<HTMLOListElement>("[data-evidence-list]");
  const evidenceEmpty = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-evidence-empty]");
  const previousButton = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-previous]");
  const nextButton = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-next]");
  const uncertainButton = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-uncertain]");
  const exportButton = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-export]");
  const resetButton = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-reset]");
  const aiDraftButton = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-ai-draft]");
  const aiDraftApplyButton = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-ai-draft-apply]");
  const aiDraftResult = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-ai-draft-result]");
  const aiDraftStatus = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-ai-draft-status]");

  let bundle: EvaluationBundle | null = null;
  let progress: EvaluationProgress | null = null;
  let currentIndex = 0;
  let saveTimer: number | undefined;
  let aiDraft: EvaluationAiDraft | null = null;

  const outcomeLabels: Record<string, string> = {
    candidate: "候補あり",
    no_candidate: "候補なし",
    episode_fragment: "未完の断片",
    hard_excluded: "除外"
  };
  const usefulnessLabels: Record<string, string> = {
    durable_memory: "永続化対象",
    operational_history_only: "時系列・再発防止には有用／永続化対象外",
    not_useful: "将来の利用価値なし",
    excluded: "安全上の除外"
  };
  const confidenceLabels: Record<string, string> = { high: "確信度 高", medium: "確信度 中", low: "確信度 低" };

  function showError(message: string) {
    if (!importError) return;
    importError.textContent = message;
    importError.hidden = false;
  }

  function clearError() {
    if (importError) importError.hidden = true;
  }

  async function readJson(file: File): Promise<unknown> {
    if (file.size > 20 * 1024 * 1024) throw new Error("JSONは20MiB以下にしてください。");
    return JSON.parse(await file.text());
  }

  function currentCase() {
    return bundle?.cases[currentIndex] ?? null;
  }

  function currentReviewCase() {
    const item = currentCase();
    return item ? createSanitizedEvaluationCase(item) : null;
  }

  function currentAnnotation(): EvaluationAnnotation | null {
    const item = currentCase();
    if (!item || !progress) return null;
    return progress.annotations[item.id] ??= createEmptyAnnotation(item.id, new Date().toISOString(), {
      routerV32: Boolean(bundle?.router_v32),
      sourceHash: item.source_hash,
      priorAiExposure: bundle?.router_v32 ? item.prior_ai_exposure ?? "unknown" : "unknown"
    });
  }

  function annotationHasInput(annotation: EvaluationAnnotation | null): boolean {
    return Boolean(annotation && (annotation.outcome || annotation.usefulness || annotation.confidence || annotation.note.trim()
      || annotation.exclusion_reason.trim() || annotation.future_use?.trim() || annotation.lesson_types.length || annotation.evidence_spans.length));
  }

  function annotationReviewed(annotation: EvaluationAnnotation | undefined): boolean {
    return isAnnotationComplete(annotation) || Boolean(bundle?.router_v32 && annotation?.review_status === "uncertain");
  }

  function loadAiDraft() {
    aiDraft = currentCase()?.ai_draft ?? null;
    if (aiDraftPanel) aiDraftPanel.hidden = Boolean(bundle?.router_v32);
    if (bundle?.router_v32) {
      aiDraft = null;
      return;
    }
    if (aiDraftResult) aiDraftResult.hidden = !aiDraft;
    if (aiDraftStatus) aiDraftStatus.textContent = aiDraft
      ? `${aiDraft.model}/${aiDraft.reasoning_effort}の事前評価です。内容を確認してから人の回答へ反映してください。`
      : "事前評価なし";
    if (aiDraftButton) {
      aiDraftButton.disabled = false;
      aiDraftButton.textContent = aiDraft ? "再評価" : "AI評価";
    }
    if (aiDraft) renderAiDraft();
  }

  function renderAiDraft() {
    if (!aiDraft || !aiDraftResult) return;
    aiDraftResult.hidden = false;
    const outcome = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-ai-draft-outcome]");
    const usefulness = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-ai-draft-usefulness]");
    const confidence = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-ai-draft-confidence]");
    const rationale = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-ai-draft-rationale]");
    const spans = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-ai-draft-spans]");
    const applyNote = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-ai-draft-apply-note]");
    if (outcome) outcome.textContent = outcomeLabels[aiDraft.outcome] ?? aiDraft.outcome;
    if (usefulness) usefulness.textContent = usefulnessLabels[aiDraft.usefulness] ?? aiDraft.usefulness;
    if (confidence) confidence.textContent = confidenceLabels[aiDraft.confidence] ?? aiDraft.confidence;
    if (rationale) rationale.textContent = aiDraft.rationale;
    if (spans) {
      spans.replaceChildren();
      if (aiDraft.support_spans.length) {
        const heading = document.createElement("strong");
        heading.textContent = "AIが有用と判断した箇所";
        const list = document.createElement("ul");
        aiDraft.support_spans.forEach((span) => {
          const item = document.createElement("li");
          const quote = document.createElement("q");
          quote.textContent = span.quote;
          const meta = document.createElement("small");
          meta.textContent = `${span.turn_id} · ${span.start}–${span.end}`;
          item.appendChild(quote);
          item.appendChild(meta);
          list.appendChild(item);
        });
        spans.appendChild(heading);
        spans.appendChild(list);
      }
    }
    const hasInput = annotationHasInput(currentAnnotation());
    if (aiDraftApplyButton) aiDraftApplyButton.disabled = hasInput;
    if (applyNote) applyNote.textContent = hasInput
      ? "人手入力済みのCASEなので比較表示のみです。既存回答は保護されています。"
      : "反映後も内容を修正できます。回答にはAI支援の記録が残ります。";
  }

  async function requestAiDraft() {
    const item = currentReviewCase();
    if (!item || !aiDraftButton || !aiDraftStatus) return;
    const characters = item.turns.reduce((sum, turn) => sum + turn.content.length, 0);
    const approved = confirm(
      `CASE ${currentIndex + 1} の表示本文（ファイル名・パス・構造タグ除去済み、${characters.toLocaleString("ja-JP")}文字）をOpenAI GPT-5.6 Solへ送信し、high reasoningで評価下書きを作成します。送信しますか？`
    );
    if (!approved) return;
    aiDraftButton.disabled = true;
    aiDraftButton.textContent = "評価中…";
    aiDraftStatus.textContent = "Sol highが下書きを作成しています。通常は数十秒かかります。";
    if (aiDraftResult) aiDraftResult.hidden = true;
    try {
      const response = await fetch("/api/evaluation-ai-draft", {
        method: "POST",
        headers: { "content-type": "application/json" },
        body: JSON.stringify({
          contract: "orgbrain-memory-extraction-ai-draft-request/v1",
          content_filter: "orgbrain-memory-extraction-review-text/v1",
          case: { id: item.id, source_hash: item.source_hash, turns: item.turns }
        })
      });
      const payload = await response.json().catch(() => null) as { data?: unknown; error?: { message?: string } } | null;
      if (!response.ok) throw new Error(payload?.error?.message ?? `AI評価に失敗しました（HTTP ${response.status}）。`);
      aiDraft = parseEvaluationAiDraft(payload?.data, item, "sanitized_review_text_v1");
      aiDraftStatus.textContent = "AI下書きができました。内容を確認してから反映してください。";
      renderAiDraft();
    } catch (error) {
      aiDraft = null;
      aiDraftStatus.textContent = error instanceof Error ? error.message : "AI評価に失敗しました。";
    } finally {
      aiDraftButton.disabled = false;
      aiDraftButton.textContent = currentCase()?.ai_draft ? "再評価" : "AI評価";
    }
  }

  function applyAiDraft() {
    const item = currentCase();
    const annotation = currentAnnotation();
    if (!item || !annotation || !progress || !aiDraft) return;
    try {
      progress.annotations[item.id] = applyEvaluationAiDraft(annotation, aiDraft);
      persist();
      updateSummary();
      renderCaseList();
      renderForm();
      renderAiDraft();
      if (aiDraftStatus) aiDraftStatus.textContent = "AI下書きを反映しました。人が確認・修正してから次へ進んでください。";
    } catch (error) {
      if (aiDraftStatus) aiDraftStatus.textContent = error instanceof Error ? error.message : "AI下書きを反映できませんでした。";
    }
  }

  function persist(showSaved = true) {
    if (!bundle || !progress) return;
    progress.updated_at = new Date().toISOString();
    localStorage.setItem(storageKey(bundle.set_id), JSON.stringify(progress));
    if (!showSaved) return;
    const saveState = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-save-state]");
    if (!saveState) return;
    saveState.textContent = "保存中…";
    window.clearTimeout(saveTimer);
    saveTimer = window.setTimeout(() => { saveState.textContent = "端末内に保存済み"; }, 220);
  }

  function isCaseAccessible(index: number): boolean {
    if (!bundle) return false;
    if (bundle.router_v32) return true;
    const summary = summarizeEvaluation(bundle, progress);
    return bundle.cases[index]?.phase === "calibration" || summary.calibrationUnlocked;
  }

  function accessibleIndex(start: number, direction: 1 | -1): number {
    if (!bundle) return -1;
    for (let index = start + direction; index >= 0 && index < bundle.cases.length; index += direction) {
      if (isCaseAccessible(index)) return index;
    }
    return -1;
  }

  function updateSummary() {
    if (!bundle) return;
    const summary = summarizeEvaluation(bundle, progress);
    const count = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-progress-count]");
    const bar = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-progress-bar]");
    const track = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-progress-track]");
    const phaseSummary = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-phase-summary]");
    const percent = summary.total ? Math.round((summary.complete / summary.total) * 100) : 0;
    if (count) count.textContent = `${summary.complete} / ${summary.total}`;
    if (bar) bar.style.width = `${percent}%`;
    if (track) track.setAttribute("aria-valuenow", String(percent));
    if (phaseSummary) {
      phaseSummary.replaceChildren();
      const calibration = document.createElement("p");
      calibration.innerHTML = `<span>${bundle.router_v32 ? "今回の40件" : "Calibration"}</span><strong>${summary.calibrationComplete} / ${summary.calibrationTotal}</strong>`;
      const locked = document.createElement("p");
      locked.innerHTML = `<span>${bundle.router_v32 ? (bundle.experiment_manifest?.dataset_role === "final_holdout" ? "Final holdout" : "開発レビュー") : "Locked test"}</span><strong>${summary.lockedComplete} / ${summary.lockedTotal}</strong>`;
      const gate = document.createElement("small");
      gate.textContent = bundle.router_v32 ? "確定した回答はexportしてCLIのimport-reviewへ渡します" : summary.calibrationUnlocked ? "Locked test を開始できます" : "Calibration完了後にLocked testを解放";
      phaseSummary.appendChild(calibration);
      phaseSummary.appendChild(locked);
      phaseSummary.appendChild(gate);
    }
  }

  function renderCaseList() {
    if (!bundle || !caseList) return;
    const activeBundle = bundle;
    caseList.replaceChildren();
    activeBundle.cases.forEach((item, index) => {
      const annotation = progress?.annotations[item.id];
      const complete = annotationReviewed(annotation);
      const accessible = isCaseAccessible(index);
      const button = document.createElement("button");
      button.type = "button";
      button.className = "case-list-item";
      button.dataset.current = String(index === currentIndex);
      button.dataset.complete = String(complete);
      button.disabled = !accessible;
      button.setAttribute("aria-current", index === currentIndex ? "step" : "false");
      const number = document.createElement("span");
      number.textContent = String(index + 1).padStart(3, "0");
      const label = document.createElement("span");
      label.innerHTML = `<strong>${activeBundle.router_v32 ? "Router v3.2" : item.phase === "calibration" ? "Calibration" : "Locked test"}</strong><small>${complete ? annotation?.review_status === "uncertain" ? "保留" : outcomeLabels[annotation?.outcome ?? ""] ?? "完了" : accessible ? item.ai_draft ? "AI下書きあり" : "未評価" : "未解放"}</small>`;
      const mark = document.createElement("i");
      mark.textContent = complete ? "✓" : accessible ? "·" : "—";
      button.appendChild(number);
      button.appendChild(label);
      button.appendChild(mark);
      button.addEventListener("click", () => {
        currentIndex = index;
        renderCurrentCase();
        renderCaseList();
      });
      caseList.appendChild(button);
    });
  }

  function renderTurns() {
    const item = currentReviewCase();
    if (!item || !turnsRoot) return;
    turnsRoot.replaceChildren();
    item.turns.forEach((turn, index) => {
      const article = document.createElement("article");
      article.className = `episode-turn role-${turn.role}`;
      const rail = document.createElement("div");
      rail.className = "turn-rail";
      rail.innerHTML = `<span>${String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span><i></i>`;
      const body = document.createElement("div");
      body.className = "turn-body";
      const heading = document.createElement("header");
      const role = document.createElement("strong");
      role.textContent = turn.role.toUpperCase();
      const id = document.createElement("code");
      id.textContent = turn.id;
      heading.appendChild(role);
      heading.appendChild(id);
      const content = document.createElement("p");
      content.className = "turn-content";
      content.dataset.turnId = turn.id;
      content.textContent = turn.content;
      const addButton = document.createElement("button");
      addButton.type = "button";
      addButton.className = "selection-action";
      addButton.textContent = "選択範囲を追加";
      addButton.addEventListener("click", () => addSelectedEvidence(content, turn.id));
      body.appendChild(heading);
      body.appendChild(content);
      body.appendChild(addButton);
      article.appendChild(rail);
      article.appendChild(body);
      turnsRoot.appendChild(article);
    });
  }

  function addSelectedEvidence(container: HTMLElement, turnId: string) {
    const selection = window.getSelection();
    if (!selection || selection.rangeCount === 0 || selection.isCollapsed) {
      showValidation("このメッセージ内で根拠にする文を選択してください。");
      return;
    }
    const range = selection.getRangeAt(0);
    if (!container.contains(range.commonAncestorContainer)) {
      showValidation("選択範囲と追加ボタンが同じメッセージ内になるようにしてください。");
      return;
    }
    const before = range.cloneRange();
    before.selectNodeContents(container);
    before.setEnd(range.startContainer, range.startOffset);
    const rawQuote = range.toString();
    const leading = rawQuote.length - rawQuote.trimStart().length;
    const quote = rawQuote.trim();
    if (!quote) return;
    const start = before.toString().length + leading;
    const annotation = currentAnnotation();
    if (!annotation) return;
    const span: EvidenceSpan = {
      turn_id: turnId,
      quote,
      start,
      end: start + quote.length,
      basis: "sanitized_review_text_v1"
    };
    if (!annotation.evidence_spans.some((item) => item.turn_id === span.turn_id && item.start === span.start && item.end === span.end)) {
      annotation.evidence_spans.push(span);
      updateAnnotationTimestamp(annotation);
      persist();
      renderEvidence();
      updateSummary();
      renderCaseList();
    }
    selection.removeAllRanges();
    hideValidation();
  }

  function renderEvidence() {
    const annotation = currentAnnotation();
    if (!annotation || !evidenceList || !evidenceEmpty) return;
    evidenceList.replaceChildren();
    evidenceEmpty.hidden = annotation.evidence_spans.length > 0;
    annotation.evidence_spans.forEach((span, index) => {
      const item = document.createElement("li");
      const quote = document.createElement("q");
      quote.textContent = span.quote;
      const meta = document.createElement("small");
      meta.textContent = `${span.turn_id} · ${span.start}–${span.end}`;
      const remove = document.createElement("button");
      remove.type = "button";
      remove.textContent = "削除";
      remove.setAttribute("aria-label", `根拠「${span.quote.slice(0, 30)}」を削除`);
      remove.addEventListener("click", () => {
        annotation.evidence_spans.splice(index, 1);
        updateAnnotationTimestamp(annotation);
        persist();
        renderEvidence();
        updateSummary();
        renderCaseList();
      });
      item.appendChild(quote);
      item.appendChild(meta);
      item.appendChild(remove);
      evidenceList.appendChild(item);
    });
  }

  function updateConditionalFields() {
    if (!form) return;
    const outcome = new FormData(form).get("outcome");
    const candidate = outcome === "candidate";
    if (lessonFieldset) lessonFieldset.disabled = !candidate;
    if (evidenceFieldset) evidenceFieldset.disabled = !candidate;
    if (exclusionField) exclusionField.hidden = outcome !== "hard_excluded";
    if (futureUseField) futureUseField.hidden = !bundle?.router_v32 || !candidate;
    const futureUse = form.elements.namedItem("future_use") as HTMLTextAreaElement | null;
    if (futureUse) futureUse.required = Boolean(bundle?.router_v32 && candidate);
    form.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="usefulness"]').forEach((input) => {
      const allowed = outcome === "candidate"
        ? input.value === "durable_memory"
        : outcome === "hard_excluded"
          ? input.value === "excluded"
          : outcome === "no_candidate" || outcome === "episode_fragment"
            ? ["operational_history_only", "not_useful"].includes(input.value)
            : false;
      input.disabled = !allowed;
      if (!allowed) input.checked = false;
      if ((outcome === "candidate" && input.value === "durable_memory")
        || (outcome === "hard_excluded" && input.value === "excluded")) input.checked = true;
    });
  }

  function renderForm() {
    const annotation = currentAnnotation();
    if (!annotation || !form) return;
    form.reset();
    if (annotation.outcome) {
      const input = form.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`input[name="outcome"][value="${annotation.outcome}"]`);
      if (input) input.checked = true;
    }
    if (annotation.usefulness) {
      const input = form.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`input[name="usefulness"][value="${annotation.usefulness}"]`);
      if (input) input.checked = true;
    }
    annotation.lesson_types.forEach((type) => {
      const input = form.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`input[name="lesson_type"][value="${type}"]`);
      if (input) input.checked = true;
    });
    if (annotation.confidence) {
      const input = form.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`input[name="confidence"][value="${annotation.confidence}"]`);
      if (input) input.checked = true;
    }
    const reason = form.elements.namedItem("exclusion_reason") as HTMLInputElement | null;
    const note = form.elements.namedItem("note") as HTMLTextAreaElement | null;
    const futureUse = form.elements.namedItem("future_use") as HTMLTextAreaElement | null;
    if (reason) reason.value = annotation.exclusion_reason;
    if (note) note.value = annotation.note;
    if (futureUse) futureUse.value = annotation.future_use ?? "";
    updateConditionalFields();
    renderEvidence();
  }

  function updateAnnotationTimestamp(annotation: EvaluationAnnotation) {
    annotation.updated_at = new Date().toISOString();
    const complete = isAnnotationComplete(annotation);
    annotation.completed_at = complete ? annotation.completed_at ?? annotation.updated_at : null;
    if (annotation.router_v32) annotation.review_status = complete ? "accepted" : "pending";
  }

  function syncAnnotationFromForm() {
    const annotation = currentAnnotation();
    if (!annotation || !form) return;
    const data = new FormData(form);
    annotation.outcome = data.get("outcome") as EvaluationAnnotation["outcome"];
    annotation.usefulness = annotation.outcome === "candidate"
      ? "durable_memory"
      : annotation.outcome === "hard_excluded"
        ? "excluded"
        : data.get("usefulness") as EvaluationUsefulness | null;
    annotation.lesson_types = annotation.outcome === "candidate"
      ? data.getAll("lesson_type") as LessonType[]
      : [];
    annotation.exclusion_reason = annotation.outcome === "hard_excluded" ? String(data.get("exclusion_reason") ?? "").trim() : "";
    annotation.confidence = data.get("confidence") as EvaluationAnnotation["confidence"];
    annotation.note = String(data.get("note") ?? "");
    annotation.future_use = String(data.get("future_use") ?? "").trim();
    if (bundle?.router_v32) {
      annotation.router_v32 = true;
      annotation.source_hash = currentCase()?.source_hash;
      annotation.review_status = isAnnotationComplete(annotation) ? "accepted" : "pending";
      annotation.label_origin = annotation.label_origin ?? (annotation.prior_ai_exposure === "ai_assisted" ? "human_revised" : "human_blind");
      annotation.prior_ai_exposure = annotation.prior_ai_exposure ?? "none";
      annotation.revision_id = annotation.revision_id ?? `${annotation.case_id}:${annotation.started_at}`;
    }
    updateAnnotationTimestamp(annotation);
    updateConditionalFields();
    persist();
    updateSummary();
    renderCaseList();
    hideValidation();
  }

  function showValidation(message: string) {
    if (!validation) return;
    validation.textContent = message;
    validation.hidden = false;
  }

  function hideValidation() {
    if (validation) validation.hidden = true;
  }

  function renderCurrentCase() {
    const item = currentCase();
    if (!item || !bundle) return;
    document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-case-position]")!.textContent = `CASE ${currentIndex + 1} / ${bundle.cases.length}`;
    document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-case-title]")!.textContent = item.id;
    document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-case-phase]")!.textContent = bundle.router_v32
      ? (bundle.experiment_manifest?.dataset_role === "final_holdout" ? "FINAL HOLDOUT · BLIND" : "ROUTER V3.2 · BLIND")
      : item.phase === "calibration" ? "CALIBRATION" : "LOCKED TEST";
    if (previousButton) previousButton.disabled = accessibleIndex(currentIndex, -1) < 0;
    if (nextButton) nextButton.textContent = currentIndex === bundle.cases.length - 1
      ? bundle.router_v32 ? "評価を確定" : "評価を完了"
      : bundle.router_v32 ? "この評価を確定して次へ" : "完了して次へ";
    if (uncertainButton) uncertainButton.hidden = !bundle.router_v32;
    loadAiDraft();
    renderTurns();
    renderForm();
    hideValidation();
  }

  function openBundle(nextBundle: EvaluationBundle) {
    bundle = nextBundle;
    const saved = localStorage.getItem(storageKey(bundle.set_id));
    try {
      progress = saved ? parseEvaluationProgress(JSON.parse(saved), bundle) : createProgress(bundle, reviewerInput?.value ?? "reviewer-local");
    } catch {
      progress = createProgress(bundle, reviewerInput?.value ?? "reviewer-local");
    }
    if (reviewerInput && progress.reviewer_id) reviewerInput.value = progress.reviewer_id;
    currentIndex = Math.max(0, bundle.cases.findIndex((item, index) => isCaseAccessible(index) && !annotationReviewed(progress?.annotations[item.id])));
    if (workspace) workspace.hidden = false;
    if (progressInput) progressInput.disabled = false;
    persist(false);
    updateSummary();
    renderCaseList();
    renderCurrentCase();
    clearError();
  }

  bundleInput?.addEventListener("change", async () => {
    const file = bundleInput.files?.[0];
    if (!file) return;
    try {
      openBundle(parseEvaluationBundle(await readJson(file)));
    } catch (error) {
      showError(error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error));
    } finally {
      bundleInput.value = "";
    }
  });

  async function loadLoopbackBundleFromQuery() {
    const pageUrl = new URL(window.location.href);
    const source = pageUrl.searchParams.get("local_bundle_url");
    if (!source || !["127.0.0.1", "localhost"].includes(pageUrl.hostname)) return;
    try {
      const target = new URL(source, pageUrl);
      if (target.protocol !== "http:" || !["127.0.0.1", "localhost"].includes(target.hostname)) {
        throw new Error("local_bundle_url must point to a loopback HTTP server");
      }
      const response = await fetch(target, { cache: "no-store" });
      if (!response.ok) throw new Error(`ローカル評価セットを取得できませんでした（HTTP ${response.status}）。`);
      openBundle(parseEvaluationBundle(await response.json()));
      pageUrl.searchParams.delete("local_bundle_url");
      history.replaceState(null, "", `${pageUrl.pathname}${pageUrl.search}${pageUrl.hash}`);
    } catch (error) {
      showError(error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error));
    }
  }

  void loadLoopbackBundleFromQuery();

  progressInput?.addEventListener("change", async () => {
    const file = progressInput.files?.[0];
    if (!file || !bundle) return;
    try {
      progress = parseEvaluationProgress(await readJson(file), bundle);
      if (reviewerInput) reviewerInput.value = progress.reviewer_id;
      persist(false);
      updateSummary();
      renderCaseList();
      renderCurrentCase();
      clearError();
    } catch (error) {
      showError(error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error));
    } finally {
      progressInput.value = "";
    }
  });

  reviewerInput?.addEventListener("change", () => {
    if (!progress) return;
    progress.reviewer_id = reviewerInput.value.trim();
    persist();
  });

  form?.addEventListener("change", syncAnnotationFromForm);
  form?.addEventListener("input", (event) => {
    if ((event.target as HTMLElement).matches("textarea, input[type=text]")) syncAnnotationFromForm();
  });

  previousButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
    const previousIndex = accessibleIndex(currentIndex, -1);
    if (previousIndex < 0) return;
    currentIndex = previousIndex;
    renderCurrentCase();
    renderCaseList();
  });

  nextButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
    const annotation = currentAnnotation();
    if (!annotation || !isAnnotationComplete(annotation)) {
      const message = annotation?.outcome === "candidate"
        ? bundle?.router_v32 ? "候補の種類・根拠範囲・将来の利用場面・確信度を入力してください。" : "候補の種類・根拠範囲・確信度を入力してください。"
        : annotation?.outcome === "hard_excluded"
          ? "除外理由コードと確信度を入力してください。"
          : "結果・利用価値・確信度を入力してください。";
      showValidation(message);
      return;
    }
    if (!bundle || currentIndex === bundle.cases.length - 1) {
      showValidation("この評価セットの入力が完了しました。回答JSONを書き出して保管してください。");
      return;
    }
    const nextIndex = accessibleIndex(currentIndex, 1);
    if (nextIndex < 0) {
      showValidation("Calibrationをすべて完了するとLocked testが解放されます。");
      return;
    }
    currentIndex = nextIndex;
    renderCurrentCase();
    renderCaseList();
    document.querySelector("[data-case-position]")?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: "smooth", block: "start" });
  });

  uncertainButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
    const annotation = currentAnnotation();
    if (!annotation || !bundle?.router_v32) return;
    annotation.review_status = "uncertain";
    annotation.completed_at = null;
    annotation.updated_at = new Date().toISOString();
    persist();
    updateSummary();
    renderCaseList();
    const nextIndex = accessibleIndex(currentIndex, 1);
    if (nextIndex < 0) {
      showValidation("保留として記録しました。回答JSONを書き出してください。");
      return;
    }
    currentIndex = nextIndex;
    renderCurrentCase();
    renderCaseList();
  });

  exportButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
    if (!bundle || !progress) return;
    persist(false);
    const blob = new Blob([`${JSON.stringify(progress, null, 2)}\n`], { type: "application/json" });
    const link = document.createElement("a");
    link.href = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
    link.download = `${bundle.set_id}-annotations.json`;
    link.click();
    URL.revokeObjectURL(link.href);
  });

  resetButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
    if (!bundle || !confirm(`評価セット「${bundle.set_id}」の端末内回答をすべて消去しますか？`)) return;
    localStorage.removeItem(storageKey(bundle.set_id));
    progress = createProgress(bundle, reviewerInput?.value ?? "reviewer-local");
    currentIndex = 0;
    persist(false);
    updateSummary();
    renderCaseList();
    renderCurrentCase();
  });

  aiDraftButton?.addEventListener("click", requestAiDraft);
  aiDraftApplyButton?.addEventListener("click", applyAiDraft);

  document.addEventListener("keydown", (event) => {
    if (!bundle || event.metaKey || event.ctrlKey || event.altKey ||
      (event.target as HTMLElement).matches("input, textarea, select")) return;
    if (event.key === "ArrowLeft") previousButton?.click();
    if (event.key === "ArrowRight") nextButton?.click();
  });
</script>

